Meditate on your link with Nature.

While meditating, your equilibrium decreases by (2 + {{ctmd|20|120}} / 10) per turn, your Mental Save is increased by (5 + {{ctmd|10|40}}), and your healing factor increases by (5 + {{ctmd|12|30}})%.

Your deep meditation does not let you deal damage correctly, reducing the damage you and your summons deal by 50%.

